{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53488","headline":"题游息洞（题拟） · 韩愈","name":"题游息洞（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"所乐非吾独，人人共此情。\n往来三伏里，试酌一泓清。\n（见民国廿七年刊朱汝珍纂《阳山县志》卷十七《金石》）（按：《阳山县志》录《陆志》云：「右诗字大一寸五分，在游息洞口石壁。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53488.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53488","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}